  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Apal Vernacular Bible</book>
  <para style="rem">Drafted by Kenny - November 2012</para>
  <para style="rem">Checked by men July 2014 – Lun, Kenny, Nalop, Din</para>
  <para style="rem">Consultant checked 2015</para>
